{"_id":"6841ef180b34d320e1558194","title":"Fast teleport to exit no lagging at all","game":{"_id":"6817cbf59730dd5f9e2fd534","gameId":8172482293,"name":"Brother's Vow","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/999293d53aee3312ff4b356a372837468380f0509ec16ab4b04620e421dc7803.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-44865a1c05ca80451392b19e1b41f933-a1b1d55eabbf.png"},"slug":"8172482293-brother-s-vow","path":"/game/8172482293-brother-s-vow","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/999293d53aee3312ff4b356a372837468380f0509ec16ab4b04620e421dc7803.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-44865a1c05ca80451392b19e1b41f933-a1b1d55eabbf.png"},"placeId":8172482293},"slug":"Open-Testing-Brother's-Vow-Fast-teleport-to-exit-no-lagging-at-all-41829","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":28197,"executes":129,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-dea397089621c1488aef286c15767a2f-9240d9f49513.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-dea397089621c1488aef286c15767a2f-9240d9f49513.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-dea397089621c1488aef286c15767a2f-9240d9f49513.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-dea397089621c1488aef286c15767a2f-9240d9f49513.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-06-05T19:25:12.797Z","updatedAt":"2025-06-05T19:25:12.797Z","lastBump":"2025-06-05T19:25:12.797Z","script":"\nlocal speed = 200 \nlocal part = workspace.Map:WaitForChild(\"ExitPart\") \n\n\nlocal player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal character = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\nlocal hrp = character:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\nlocal destination = part.CFrame \nlocal distance = (destination.Position - hrp.Position).Magnitude\nlocal duration = distance / speed\n\nlocal TweenService = game:GetService(\"TweenService\")\nlocal tweenInfo = TweenInfo.new(duration, Enum.EasingStyle.Linear, Enum.EasingDirection.Out)\n\nlocal tween = TweenService:Create(hrp, tweenInfo, {CFrame = destination})\ntween:Play()\n","features":"Tweens you to a part called \"ExitPart\"\n\nUses TweenService for smooth movement\n\nYou can change the speed at the top\n\nWorks on any executor that supports TweenService\n\nDoesn’t insta teleport, looks more natural\n\nCan be used in obbys or exit systems\n\nClean and doesn’t lag\n\nEasy to edit if you wanna use a different part","tags":["Brothers Vow","BV","Tween","TweenService"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"66abf415561cb7837af216d7","username":"A_Coder","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"66abf415561cb7837af216d7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T03:05:48.362Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6841ef180b34d320e1558196","editBy":{"_id":"66abf415561cb7837af216d7","username":"A_Coder","status":"offline","id":"66abf415561cb7837af216d7"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-06-05T19:25:12.798Z"}],"comments":[]}